<info>
  <ul>
    <li>Tip calculator - a bill, a slider, two derived numbers</li>
    <li><code>PROPS</code> types <code>bill</code> as a Number and copies it to state with <code>state: true</code></li>
    <li><code>fez:bind</code> two-way binds both the number input and the range, no change handlers</li>
    <li>Totals are derived in <code>beforeRender()</code> - the Fez answer to memos and runes</li>
  </ul>
</info>

<demo>
  <ui-tip bill="48"></ui-tip>
</demo>

<script>
  PROPS = { bill: { type: Number, state: true, default: 48 } }

  init() {
    this.state.tip = 18
  }

  beforeRender() {
    const tip = this.state.bill * this.state.tip / 100
    this.state.tip_sum = tip.toFixed(2)
    this.state.total = (this.state.bill + tip).toFixed(2)
  }
</script>

<label>
  bill
  <input type="number" min="0" step="1" fez:bind="state.bill" />
</label>

<input type="range" min="0" max="30" fez:bind="state.tip" style="--pct: {state.tip / 30 * 100}%" />

<p class="out">
  <span>{state.tip}% tip is <b>${state.tip_sum}</b></span>
  <span class="total">total <b>${state.total}</b></span>
</p>

<style>
  display: grid;
  gap: 12px;
  width: 100%;

  label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #888;

    input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 8px 11px;
      font: inherit;
      color: #111;
      border: 1px solid #d8d8d8;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
  }

  input[type="range"] {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
    width: 100%;
    height: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    /* --pct is written from state, so the filled part follows the value */
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0ea5e9 var(--pct), #e9e9ee var(--pct));
    cursor: ew-resize;

    &::-webkit-slider-thumb {
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    }

    &::-moz-range-thumb {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #fff;
    }
  }

  .out {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #f1f1f4;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #888;

    b {
      color: #111;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .total b {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  }
</style>
